  vignettes:
  - image: {fileID: 1951639049, guid: 22212bbef61a56941af22e4a8ee82db7, type: 3}
    text: ' You did it, you were able to get all the positive things in the world
      back, after a long and arduous journey!'
  - image: {fileID: 1831015359, guid: 22212bbef61a56941af22e4a8ee82db7, type: 3}
    text: "The soul tree blossoms again, symbolising the regained hope and the bright
      future\u2026"
  - image: {fileID: -116059307, guid: 22212bbef61a56941af22e4a8ee82db7, type: 3}
    text: The evil monster has no more hatred inside itself, it has lost all the
      malice coming from the bad feelings of the whole planet...
  - image: {fileID: -1546845187, guid: 22212bbef61a56941af22e4a8ee82db7, type: 3}
    text: Now, you can really start your new stage, with all that you have learnt
      you will surely become a better person...
  nextButtonText: Next
